      en: ["The mountain rises to an altitude of 797 meters above sea level.", "Its English name, Bible Rock, comes from its resemblance to an open book.", "It was used by the British as a strategic landmark for visual signaling.", "The geological composition consists of ancient Precambrian gneiss rock.", "The summit offers a 360-degree view of the Kegalle District landscape.", "The area is home to various endemic avian species and tropical flora."],
