      en: ["The Mahaweli River is 335 kilometers long, the longest in Sri Lanka.", "The valley drainage basin covers nearly 16% of the island's land area.", "The Victoria Dam, located here, is a double-curvature arch dam.", "The valley project is the largest multipurpose development in Sri Lankan history.", "Ancient kings used the river as a natural defense for the city of Kandy.", "It provides irrigation water to the dry zone provinces of the north and east."],
